    <sys:String x:Key="AiSettingPage_Glossary">Glossary (local SDE Chinese-English terms)</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="AiSettingPage_UseGlossary">Inject glossary</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="AiSettingPage_UseGlossary_Desc">Before translating, matched proper nouns (items/ships/systems/regions/stations) are injected as a term list so names match the game.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="AiSettingPage_GlossaryLimit">Max terms per request</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="AiSettingPage_GlossaryLimit_Desc">Only terms related to the current sentence are injected; 30 terms is roughly 300–600 tokens. 0 disables injection.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="AiSettingPage_ChunkSize">Max characters per request</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="AiSettingPage_ChunkSize_Desc">Longer text is split into several chunks (cut at paragraph/sentence ends) and merged back. 0 = never split, send everything in one request. The default 12000 is tiny for modern models (128K–1M token context); smaller chunks surface the first result sooner and lose less on a failure, larger chunks mean fewer requests.</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="AiSettingPage_Thinking">Thinking mode</sys:String>
    <sys:String x:Key="AiSettingPage_Thinking_Desc">Only sent to DeepSeek endpoints (other providers do not know the parameter, so it is skipped automatically). DeepSeek defaults to "enabled + high", which writes a long chain of thought before every translation — slow, expensive and it also disables temperature. Keep it off for translation.</sys:String>
